---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE, LEGAL_UPDATED } from '../lib/site.js';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Idaho Conditions" description="What Idaho Conditions collects and why.">
  <main>
    <div class="wrap">
      <PageHero title="Privacy." lede="Short version: we only ask for an email address, and only if you want the Thursday Brief." />
      <div class="doc">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>If you sign up for the Thursday Conditions Brief, we collect your email address so we can send it. Nothing else is required, and you don’t need an account to use the site. If you write to us, we keep your message and address so we can reply.</p>

        <h2>Who handles it</h2>
        <p>Idaho Conditions is operated by Troutdog Adventures LLC, an Idaho limited liability company.</p>
        <p>The email list is run by beehiiv, which stores addresses and sends the emails. The signup form is loaded from beehiiv, so opening the home page makes your browser contact beehiiv, which can see ordinary request details such as your IP address, before you type anything. We don’t sell or share your address. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and you can also write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> to be removed. We keep your address until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it.</p>

        <h2>Email tracking</h2>
        <p>beehiiv can record whether an email was opened and which links were clicked. We use that in summary to see which sections people find useful.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
        <p>The site itself doesn’t use accounts, advertising cookies or ad trackers. The beehiiv signup form may store a small item in your browser to remember that you signed up or closed the form. Cloudflare, which hosts the site, keeps ordinary server logs and may use cookies needed for security. Fonts are served from this site, so loading them sends nothing to Google or any other font service.</p>

        <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
        <p>Links to other sites (weather.gov, 511.idaho.gov and so on) are governed by those sites.</p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>Idaho Conditions isn’t aimed at children under 13, and we don’t knowingly collect their information.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this changes, we’ll update this page and the date below.</p>

        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>

        <p class="footer-note"><em>Last updated: {LEGAL_UPDATED}.</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
